      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和训练员Cosplay的『莱基』的那种搭档感也\n超棒的！　我觉得能讨伐最强杀手的就只有这两个人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f62d122f8f301be819f38c29366b7c8609fa7bdc0ee640df4367694776cebe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
